push.test_notes:
Troubleshooting:
   - OneBot / NapCat: make sure NapCat is logged into QQ and its HTTP server is on (default http://127.0.0.1:3000), and the token matches what is shown above;
   - shows success but nothing arrives: usually a wrong target (group id vs personal QQ id) - sending to a group needs push.target_type: group;
   - 403 means wrong token; connection refused means the service is down or the port is wrong.
